/Assets/Layer\ Lab/GUI\ Pro-CasualGame/ResourcesData/Sprites/Components/Icon_PictoIcons/512/
/Assets/Layer\ Lab/GUI\ Pro-CasualGame/ResourcesData/Sprites/Components/Icon_PictoIcons/512.meta

# Stylized Water 3 (Staggart, paid): the demo scene and models stay out; the shaders / runtime / materials the sea needs are tracked
/Assets/Stylized\ Water\ 3/_Demo/
/Assets/Stylized\ Water\ 3/_Demo.meta
/Assets/Stylized\ Water\ 3/Models/
/Assets/Stylized\ Water\ 3/Models.meta
/Assets/Stylized\ Water\ 3/Prefabs/
/Assets/Stylized\ Water\ 3/Prefabs.meta
# an old Built-in "Stylized Water" that came in with it: unused (the game is URP)
/Assets/Stylized\ Water/
/Assets/Stylized\ Water.meta

# Casual RPG VFX (Lana Studio, paid, 110 MB): only the Fire / Burst / Range_attack prefabs the game uses, their materials, textures and models are tracked
/Assets/Lana\ Studio/Casual\ RPG\ VFX/Demo/
/Assets/Lana\ Studio/Casual\ RPG\ VFX/Demo.meta
